<title>FINLAND: Finnish Q1 GDP down 0.4 pct q/q, up 4.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Q1 GDP down 0.4 pct q/q, up 4.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) at market prices rose 4.0 percent year-on-year in the first quarter of 1997, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, Q1 GDP fell 0.4 percent on Q4, 1996, SF said.  </p>
<p>			  Q1 1997	 Q4 1996	 Q1 1996</p>
<p> Quarter/Quarter    -0.4 pct	+1.3 pct	+0.7 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +4.0 pct	+5.8 pct	+1.5 pct</p>
<p>The median of 10 analysts' forecasts for Q1 GDP growth was 5.2 percent in a 4.5 - 5.5 percent range.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
